      "heading": "Why price may revisit an imbalance.",
      "body": "Traders commonly explain it like this:<ul class=\"p3-list\"><li>Price moved through the area quickly, with little two-sided trading.</li><li>Some traders watch those areas, so activity may show up there again.</li><li>Orders that missed the fast move may still be interested in those prices.</li></ul>These are <strong>explanations</strong>, not laws. Sometimes price comes back fast. Sometimes much later. Sometimes never."
